  "bodyText": "Search\nBuy\nSell\nMy REALTOR®\nMarket Tools\nLog in\nHouse for rent\n2 38xx W 36th Avenue, Dunbar, Vancouver\nGoogle Maps\nStreet View\n$2,900\n/month\n8\nFeatures\n?\nLifestyle\n 2 bedrooms\n 1 bathroom\nFloor Area\n750 sqft\nLaundry Features\nIn Unit\nAppliances\nDishwasher, Refrigerator\nCooling Features\nAir Conditioning\nBylaws Restriction\nSmoking Restrictions\nDescription\nLocated in the prestigious Dunbar neighborhood of Vancouver West, this brand new, self-contained 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom basement suite offers a blend of quality, comfort, and convenience. Private separate entrance, bright living space, a modern gourmet kitchen, and dedicated in-suite laundry. Setting a new standard for suite living, it boasts premium independent air conditioning and cozy in-floor radiant heating. This property is ideal for high-profile tenants, UBC scholars, or premium families seeking access to excellent public education.Street parking. No pets. Rent includes gas water electricity. Furnished or unfurnished.\nMLS® No.  R3159353\nLocation\nWalk Score\n100\nIn accordance with our Terms of Use, location data are provided to you “as-is”, without warranty. Any liability arising from location data is expressly excluded.\nListing REALTOR®\nBob Zhong\nREALTOR®\nLuxmore Realty\nContact the REALTOR®\nShowing with the Listing REALTOR®\n\nBook an appointment with the listing REALTOR® to tour the property at your own pace, in person.\n\nRequest a showing\nCalculators\nMortgage payments\nPrice of property\n$\nDown payment\n$\n%\nMortgage amount\n$0.00\nInterest rate\n%\nAmortization\nyears\nPayment frequency\nMonthly\nCalculate\nPayment amount\n$0.00\nSee monthly payment chart\nProperty transfer tax\nFair Market Value\n$\nCalculate\n1% of $200,000\n$0.00\n2% of remaining value up to and including $2,000,000\n$0.00\n3% of remaining portion over $2,000,000\n$0.00\nEstimated Property Transfer Tax\n$0.00\nBorrowing capacity\nPayment amount\n$\nPayment frequency\nMonthly\nInterest rate\n%\nAmortization\nyears\nCalculate\nMortgage amount\n$0.00\nThe amounts shown above are for information purposes only and do not include taxes, if applicable.\nYou must purchase mortgage default insurance if your down payment is less than 20 per cent of the purchase price of the property.\nThis calculator doesn't calculate the further 2% tax on residential property greater than $3,000,000 or the additional property transfer tax on residential property transfers to foreign entities or taxable trustees. Learn more about property transfer tax.\nThere are additional costs to buying a home. Speak with your REALTOR® for more information.\nDISCOVER REALTYLINK.ORG\n\nRealtylink.org is a property search website hosted by REALTORS® at Greater Vancouver REALTORS®, Fraser Valley Real Estate Board, Vancouver Island Real Estate Board, BC Northern Real Estate Board, and Chilliwack and District Real Estate Board.\n\nDiscover Realtylink.org\nWORKING WITH A REALTOR®\n\nWhether you’re buying or selling a home, it’s important to understand from the outset how professional representation can help you at every step of the process.\n\nHow Realtors help\nCONTACT REALTYLINK.ORG\n\nDo you have any questions or comments for us?\n\nContact Realtylink.org\nView regions\n\n\n\nThe trademarks REALTOR®, REALTORS®, and the REALTOR® logo are controlled by The Canadian Real Estate Association (CREA) and identify real estate professionals who are members of CREA. The trademarks MLS®, Multiple Listing Service® and the associated logos are owned by CREA and identify the quality of services provided by real estate professionals who are members of CREA.\n\n© Centris 2026. All rights reserved.\nSite privacy policy and terms of use",
